<title>ALBANIA: Albania foreign trade deficit widens in 1996 Q2.</title>
<headline>Albania foreign trade deficit widens in 1996 Q2.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following economic indicators on Wednesday:</p>
<p> ALBANIAN FOREIGN TRADE (MLN LEKS)    1996 Q2    1995 Q2</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance	    -16,592.4   -13,017</p>
<p> Exports					5,439.4     4,656</p>
<p> Imports				     22,031.8    17,673</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
